The MIT license above covers the editor's own source code.

`data/fli_text.json.gz`, `data/fli_gear.json.gz` and `data/icons/` are built
from the shipping game's own data tables and art. That content belongs to
LEVEL5 Inc. and is included only so the editor can show real names and icons
instead of raw ids; it is not covered by the license above and is not licensed
for reuse. `tools/build_textdb.py`, `tools/build_geardb.py` and
`tools/build_icons.py` rebuild all three from your own copy of the game.

Fantasy Life is a trademark of LEVEL5 Inc. This project is an unofficial,
non-commercial fan tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by LEVEL5.
